{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24959","headline":"处厚游杭作诗寄之 · 牟融","name":"处厚游杭作诗寄之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江村摇落暂逢秋，况是闻君独远游。\n浙水风烟思吊古，楚乡人物赋登楼。\n书沈寒鴈云边影，梦绕清猨月下愁。\n念我故人劳碌久，不如投老卧沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}